# Route: guide 50 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to
# 60, 55 quests, 3.2 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Thousand Needles, Duskwood, Stormwind City, Eastern Plaguelands,
# Darnassus, Winterspring, Azshara, Wetlands, Dun Morogh): The Shimmering
# Flats -> Darkshire -> Manor Mistmantle -> Darkshire -> Raven Hill Cemetery
# -> near Stormwind City -> near Stormwind -> Stormwind City -> Quel'Lithien
# Lodge -> Darrowshire -> Craftsmen's Terrace -> near Craftsmen's Terrace ->
# Craftsmen's Terrace -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): High Chief Winterfall (5121; High
# Chief Winterfall 59); The Final Piece (5123; High Chief Winterfall 59); The
# Name of the Beast (3510; Hetaera 55).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Crone of the Kraul (1101), Gahz'rilla (2770), Crime
# and Punishment (377), Crime and Punishment (377), Quell The Uprising (387),
# Quell the Uprising (387), The Color of Blood (388), The Color of Blood
# (388), The Stockade Riots (391), The Stockade Riots (391), Underground
# Assault (2040), Underground Assault (2040), Bring the Light (3636), A Green
# Sample (92456), A Green Sample (92456), Power Overwhelming (92489), Power
# Overwhelming (92489), Dawn's Gambit (4771), The Flesh Does Not Lie (5212),
# The Active Agent (5213), The Great Fras Siabi (5214), Houses of the Holy
# (5243), The Archivist (5251), Above and Beyond (5263), The Restless Souls
# (5282), Menethil's Gift (5463), Plagued Hatchlings (5529), Dead Man's Plea
# (8945), Anthion's Old Friend (8948), In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight
# Falls (1199), Drakefire Amulet (6502), The Fury Runs Deep (378), The Fury
# Runs Deep (378), Lost in the Thicket Things (95647), Fallen in the Fen
# (95795), Heartwoven (95809), Highland Hides (98815), Highland Hides (98815),
# Prehistoric Prism (98824), Prehistoric Prism (98824), A Fine Mess (2904),
# The Sparklematic 5200! (2951), The Only Cure is More Green Glow (2962), The
# Only Cure is More Green Glow (2962), Hurley Blackbreath (4126), Old
# Ironforge Incursion (96393), Old Ironforge Incursion (96393).

